    "description": "The creator of the big names of the industry is finally back to life with its tremendous new venues, which is equipped with the most leading facilities not only in the middle east but in the whole of the African content. Therefore, the main goal is an establishment of new prospects in the region by introducing cultures and arts from all over the world to the audience and for developing the capability of its performing companies.Objectives\n\nThe main goal is to attain the original theater architecture by restoration, by regaining its astounding effects among its audience not only in the Middle East but also for the whole African area. Main objective is to develop the national theater and the urban context in an appealing attractive design to maintain its audience likability and to regain its popularity.Challenges\n\nDeveloping the national theater and new avenues with new designs. Demolish all preservative buildings and slums around the original building to maintain a fascinating look to attract the audience developing exists and entries by developing the whole area of theaters complex (national ,puppet and taleaa theaters) regaining the original architecture using highest techniques for the rehabilitationdesign & planning\n\nThe national Egyptian theater is an artistic landmark eminent for leadership, excellence and imagination. It has sculpted itself as a compelling place in the cultural landscape of Egypt and the Middle East. It mainly supports, learning innovation and creativity, within its engaging mix of high-quality cultural events and its unique venues and state of art, also the theater is exceptionally well-suited to fulfill its mission and become a symbol of art and culture in Egypt and the world. Here’s come cube consultant main job and plan about which architecture has to do with planning, designing and constructing form, space and ambiance to reflect functional, technical, social, environmental and aesthetic considerations. Which cube consultant will provide properly. It also requires the creativity, the manipulation and coordination of materials and technology, and of light and shadow. Cube mission is creating values for clients, employees, owners and society. Cube consultants is a growing, employee-owned firm providing advisory, design, management, and operational solutions to meet the local and international requirements and needs, and emerging challenges worldwide. Therefore it will lead to a renovation for the national theater and will revive it as its own the key to restoration.\n\nThe National Theater Development",
